### Peticións de exemplo para o cliente HTTP de IntelliJ / VS Code (REST Client).
### Executar en orde: os logins gardan os tokens en variables globais.

@host = http://localhost:18080

### 1. Login como user (o JWT chega na cabeceira Authorization)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "user", "password": "1234" }

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.headers.valueOf("Authorization")); %}

### 2. Login como admin
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "1234" }

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.headers.valueOf("Authorization")); %}

### 3. Rexistro (201 + Location). Repetilo devolve 409
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userID": "lucia", "name": "Lucía", "password": "segredo" }

### 4. Renovar o JWT co refresh token da cookie (non precisa JWT)
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh

### 5. Bancos mellor valorados (HAL paxinado con ligazóns first/next/last)
GET {{host}}/benches?size=5&sort=averageMark,desc
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 6. Busca combinada: texto + tipo + nota mínima
GET {{host}}/benches?q=parque&type=Wooden&minMark=7
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 7. Busca xeográfica: bancos a menos de 500 m da Catedral
GET {{host}}/benches?lat=42.8805&lon=-8.5456&radius=0.5
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 8. Un banco (fixarse na cabeceira ETag)
GET {{host}}/benches/1
Authorization: {{user_token}}

> {% client.global.set("etag", response.headers.valueOf("ETag")); %}

### 9. Petición condicional → 304 Not Modified
GET {{host}}/benches/1
Authorization: {{user_token}}
If-None-Match: {{etag}}

### 10. Crear un banco (o propietario é o usuario autenticado)
POST {{host}}/benches
Authorization: {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Banco da Praza do Toural",
  "description": "Xunto á fonte",
  "latitude": 42.8786,
  "longitude": -8.5455,
  "type": "Stone",
  "covered": false
}

> {% client.global.set("bench", response.body.benchID); %}

### 11. Modificar con JSON-Patch (só propietario ou admin)
PATCH {{host}}/benches/{{bench}}
Authorization: {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json

[
  { "op": "replace", "path": "/description", "value": "Xunto á fonte, ao sol pola tarde" },
  { "op": "replace", "path": "/covered", "value": false }
]

### 12. JSON-Patch que deixa o recurso inválido → 400 con lista de erros
PATCH {{host}}/benches/{{bench}}
Authorization: {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json

[ { "op": "replace", "path": "/latitude", "value": 123 } ]

### 13. Predición de sombra por horas (posición solar + Open-Meteo)
GET {{host}}/benches/1/shade?from=8&to=20
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 14. Banco cuberto: sempre á sombra
GET {{host}}/benches/4/shade
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 15. Valorar un banco (a media recalcúlase en segundo plano)
POST {{host}}/benches/{{bench}}/reviews
Authorization: {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mark": 8, "note": "Moi agradable" }

> {% client.global.set("review", response.body.reviewID); %}

### 16. Valorar de novo → 409 con Location da valoración existente
POST {{host}}/benches/{{bench}}/reviews
Authorization: {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mark": 2 }

### 17. Ver a media actualizada
GET {{host}}/benches/{{bench}}
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 18. Modificar a valoración propia
PATCH {{host}}/reviews/{{review}}
Authorization: {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json

[ { "op": "replace", "path": "/mark", "value": 9 } ]

### 19. Comentar un banco
POST {{host}}/benches/1/comments
Authorization: {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Alguén sabe se o arranxaron?" }

### 20. Subir unha foto (multipart)
POST {{host}}/benches/{{bench}}/photos
Authorization: {{user_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="banco.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../main/resources/static/img/img7.jpg
--boundary--

### 21. Fotos dun banco
GET {{host}}/benches/1/photos
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 22. Descargar a miniatura (pública, con Cache-Control)
GET {{host}}/photos/1/content?thumbnail=true

### 23. Gardar un banco na lista (idempotente)
PUT {{host}}/users/user/favorites/2
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 24. Like (un por usuario)
PUT {{host}}/users/user/likes/2
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 25. Lista de bancos gardados
GET {{host}}/users/user/favorites
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 26. Usuarios v1 (paxinado, por defecto)
GET {{host}}/users
Authorization: {{user_token}}
API-Version: 1

### 27. Usuarios v0 (lista sen paxinar)
GET {{host}}/users
Authorization: {{user_token}}
API-Version: 0

### 28. Modificar o perfil doutro usuario → 403
PATCH {{host}}/users/admin
Authorization: {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json

[ { "op": "replace", "path": "/name", "value": "Hacker" } ]

### 29. O admin pode borrar calquera banco
DELETE {{host}}/benches/{{bench}}
Authorization: {{admin_token}}

### 30. Pechar sesión (invalida os refresh tokens)
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
Authorization: {{user_token}}
